{"q":"643","t":"Maximum Average Subarray I","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>You are given an integer array <code>nums</code> consisting of <code>n</code> elements, and an integer <code>k</code>.</p>\n\n<p>Find a contiguous subarray whose <strong>length is equal to</strong> <code>k</code> that has the maximum average value and return <em>this value</em>. Any answer with a calculation error less than <code>10<sup>-5</sup></code> will be accepted.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> nums = [1,12,-5,-6,50,3], k = 4\n<strong>Output:</strong> 12.75000\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> Maximum average is (12 - 5 - 6 + 50) / 4 = 51 / 4 = 12.75\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> nums = [5], k = 1\n<strong>Output:</strong> 5.00000\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>n == nums.length</code></li>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= k &lt;= n &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>4</sup> &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"findMaxAverage\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"nums\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"k\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"double\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Sliding Window","slug":"sliding-window"}],"s":[{"t":"Maximum Average Subarray II","s":"maximum-average-subarray-ii","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"K Radius Subarray Averages","s":"k-radius-subarray-averages","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["tcs","tcs"],["Meta","facebook"],["Yandex","yandex"],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["JPMorgan Chase","jpmorgan"]],"cs":{"a":[["Amazon","amazon",7],["Google","google",6],["Microsoft","microsoft",6],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",4],["tcs","tcs",3]],"b":[["Meta","facebook",2]],"m":[["JPMorgan Chase","jpmorgan",2],["Infosys","infosys",2],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs",2],["Uber","uber",2],["Yandex","yandex",2]]}}